 const cu=$("cardU");cu.innerHTML=`<h3>UNDO</h3><h4>GUARDIAN OF YOUR WALLET</h4><p>❚❚ PAUSE<b>freezes a theft</b></p><p>◀◀ REWIND<b>sends it home</b></p><p>RANGE<b>5 minutes</b></p><p>MOVES MONEY<b>only back to you</b></p><p>ITS OWN KEYS<b>0</b></p>`;
